{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25249","headline":"奉送李相公重镇襄阳 · 李逢吉","name":"奉送李相公重镇襄阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内埏埴徧，汉阴旌斾还。\n望留丹阙下，恩在紫霄间。\n冰雪背秦岭，风烟经武关。\n树皆人尚爱，辕即吏曾攀。\n自惜两心合，相看双鬓斑。\n终期谢戎务，同隐凿龙山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}